  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-cd861a22-7fff-eb82-5ade-00732b0cfab9&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of a lack of sufficient energy efficiency measures and/or financial contribution towards carbon offsetting, would fail to achieve the maximum feasible reductions in carbon dioxide emissions, contrary to Hackney Local Plan (LP33) Policy LP55 and London Plan (2021) Policy SI2. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-6ef57227-7fff-6bdb-8473-b572871431b9&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed upward extension, by reason of its excessive height, bulk and cumulative impact, would appear as an overly dominant and incongruous addition that fails to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the host building and the South Shoreditch Conservation Area, contrary to Policies D1, D3, D4 and HC1 of the London Plan and Policies LP1 and LP3 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033. No public benefits have been identified that would outweigh the level of harm caused.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-4f71bde7-7fff-2e5b-5d32-09ca4622c424&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposal fails to demonstrate the provision of adequate, secure and accessible cycle parking, contrary to Policies LP41, LP42 and LP43 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and Policy T5 of the London Plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-1e558759-7fff-6cdb-50d3-a111b15f10d8&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate that adequate and accessible refuse and recycling storage can be accommodated, contrary to Policies LP2 and LP44 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-4a5ccf36-7fff-a76f-100a-199ea77df57b&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of lack of provision of affordable housing, would fail to adequately contribute towards the provision of mixed and balanced communities and housing need in the local area. As such, the development would not be consistent with Policies H4 and H5 of the London Plan (2021), Hackney Local Plan Policies LP12, LP13 and NPPF (2024) paragraph 63 and the Hackney S106 Planning Contributions Supplementary Planning Document (2020).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of a suitable undertaking to secure that the occupiers of the new residential units would not be able to apply for on street parking permit, the proposals would have an adverse impact on street parking conditions, highway safety and sustainable modes of transport, contrary to Policies T1 and T4 of the London Plan (2021) and Hackney Local Plan Policies LP43 and LP45.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
